<decision #establish-workflow-run-lifecycle.freeze-boundary apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV968>
  运行应从 current workflow resource 还是冻结 instance revision 恢复？
  </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV968>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV969>
    始终使用 Instance 冻结的 definition revision。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV969>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96A>
    创建 Instance 时内容寻址保存 canonical XNL bundle snapshot；start、resume 与 replay 禁止重新解析 current publication。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96A>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96B>
    这是 resource 修改后保持既有运行可定位、可重复和可恢复的必要条件。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96B>
    <evidence ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96C>
    源端 Type/Instance package fingerprint 与 checkpoint replay 生命周期。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96C>
  )>
)>

<decision #establish-workflow-run-lifecycle.confirmation apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96D>
  authoring publication confirmation 是否可以同时授权执行？
  </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96D>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96E>
    不可以，执行具有独立 confirmation gate。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96E>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96F>
    未经 confirmed start 只返回冻结预览，不写 Run facts、不创建 actor effect。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96F>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96G>
    发布资源与消耗资源/触发外部副作用是不同 authority transition。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96G>
    <evidence ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96H>
    源端 start operation 的 confirmed 输入与无副作用 preview contract。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96H>
  )>
)>

<decision #establish-workflow-run-lifecycle.material-revision apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96J>
  Material binding 与 replay 是否允许解析 latest revision？
  </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96J>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96K>
    不允许；binding、receipt 与 replay 都使用 exact immutable revision。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96K>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96M>
    逻辑 Material ref 只用于发现；任何执行边界必须冻结 content-addressed revision，lease 阻止仍被引用的 revision 被 cleanup。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96M>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96N>
    否则 later rebind 会改变历史 run 的输入和 replay 结果。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96N>
    <evidence ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96P>
    源端 material manifest、receipt、replay 与 cleanup lease 协议。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96P>
  )>
)>

<decision #establish-workflow-run-lifecycle.fact-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96Q>
  workflow 是否复制 Eidolon actor/session 的执行事实？
  </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96Q>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96R>
    不复制，只保存 workflow facts 与稳定引用。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96R>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96S>
    workflow store 单写 Type/Instance/Run descriptor/Material receipt；节点图 facts 由 depa-flows store 持有，agent/tool/human lifecycle 由 Eidolon actor/session/runtime-control 持有。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96S>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96T>
    避免多个恢复 authority 和不一致 durable head。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96T>
    <evidence ?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96V>
    mission 已接受的 workflow-facts-only 与 actor reuse 决策。
    </?01M05F1PQX4H734AF4A3YDV96V>
  )>
)>
